  Code: C5
  Title: Waiting on the returned Sequence
  Summary: Play returns the DOTween Sequence, so a coroutine can wait on it.
  Watch: Dot, the white line
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 2119642986}
  - {fileID: 79549954}
  HowTo: In play mode press WaitForCompletion.
  Expect: The white line reads 'yield return ...' while the dot pulses, then 'done
    waiting' the moment it stops.
