  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: C7
  Title: PlayAnimation / StopAnimation from UnityEvents
  Summary: "Buttons wired with no code: On Click \u2192 UIAnimationPlayer \u2192
    PlayAnimation (string) / StopAnimation (string)."
  Watch: Bar; the buttons' On Click
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1701200796}
  HowTo: Select a button and look at its On Click. In play mode press Fill, Stop
    half way, Fill again, Empty.
  Expect: On Click shows UIAnimationPlayer.PlayAnimation with the name typed in.
    Stop halts the bar where it is; Fill carries on from there.
