  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: C4
  Title: ApplyFromState and CaptureBaseline
  Summary: ApplyFromState jumps to an animation's start without playing. CaptureBaseline
    re-reads resting values after code moved something.
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1122614005}
  HowTo: 'In play mode: ApplyFromState, then Play Drop In. Then Move + CaptureBaseline,
    and Play Drop In and Play Home again.'
  Expect: ApplyFromState lifts the box and hides it, and nothing moves until Drop
    In. After Move + CaptureBaseline, Drop In and Home land on the box's new spot.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 900
  StageHeight: 260
